@page
@model StudentsModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Information for Students";
}

<section class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Explore Kasper College: World-Class Facilities, Vibrant Student Life, and Support for Your Success</h1>
        <p>A Comprehensive Student Guide to Campus Resources, Academic Support, Student Union, Careers, and Living in Sheffield.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block" aria-labelledby="student-intro">
    <div class="container two-col">
        <div>
            <h2 id="student-intro">Life at Kasper College</h2>
            <p>
                At Kasper College, we are committed to providing our students with an inspiring, supportive, and cutting-edge environment
                to learn, create, innovate, and thrive. Our state-of-the-art campus in Sheffield has been purposefully designed to cater
                to the demands of modern computing, creative design, digital media, and networking disciplines. Whether you are building
                distributed systems, analyzing cyber threats, crafting immersive video games, or designing sustainable interior spaces,
                Kasper College provides the infrastructure and community you need to excel.
            </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="media-figure">
            <img src="~/images/image4.jpeg" alt="Students working together in Kasper College study pods" />
            <figcaption>Collaborative learning and student community spaces across our Sheffield campus.</figcaption>
        </figure>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block section-alt" aria-labelledby="student-facilities">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 id="student-facilities">1. Our Campus Facilities &amp; Specialist Workspaces</h2>
        <div class="grid-cards">
            <article class="card">
                <h3>1. Advanced Computing Laboratories</h3>
                <p>Our high-performance computing labs are equipped with high-specification multi-core workstations, dual-screen setups, and high-end NVIDIA RTX graphics cards. Systems are configured with dual-boot Linux and Windows environments loaded with industry-standard development toolchains, including Visual Studio, JetBrains All Products Pack, Docker, Kubernetes, MATLAB, and specialized data science libraries.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>2. Cybersecurity Operations Centre (SOC) &amp; Cyber Range</h3>
                <p>An isolated, sandboxed digital environment where cybersecurity students can practice offensive and defensive security tactics, ethical hacking, malware dissection, network intrusion detection, and incident response simulations without risk to public networks.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>3. Networking &amp; Cloud Infrastructure Suites</h3>
                <p>Featuring dedicated Cisco enterprise routing and switching racks, patch bays, fiber termination equipment, hardware firewalls, and server clusters. Students gain direct physical and virtual experience configuring complex software-defined local and wide area networks.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>4. Creative Design &amp; Digital Media Studios</h3>
                <p>Filled with natural light and designed for open collaboration, our design studios feature 27-inch 5K Apple iMacs, Wacom Cintiq 24 Pro interactive pen displays, color-calibrated monitors, and large-format printing equipment. Every workstation has full access to the complete Adobe Creative Cloud suite, Cinema 4D, and Figma.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>5. 3D Prototyping &amp; Fabrication Workshop</h3>
                <p>Turn digital blueprints into physical realities. The workshop houses high-precision SLA resin and FDM 3D printers, Epilog laser cutters, CNC milling machines, vacuum formers, electronics assembly soldering stations, and specialized traditional wood and metal model-making tools.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>6. Virtual &amp; Augmented Reality (VR/AR) Immersion Lab</h3>
                <p>Equipped with cutting-edge Meta Quest Pro and HTC Vive Focus 3 headsets, high-resolution optical motion capture cameras, and spatial audio monitors, allowing students to develop, test, and benchmark interactive VR/AR experiences and games.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>7. Double-Height 300-Seat Lecture Theatre</h3>
                <p>Our main lecture theatre features dual 4K laser projection systems, broadcast-quality audio capture, comfortable tiered seating with integrated power outlets, and assistive hearing induction loops for major keynote lectures and industry guest masterclasses.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>8. Collaborative Study Pods &amp; Meeting Rooms</h3>
                <p>Bookable project pods scattered across campus accommodate teams of 4 to 10 students. Each pod features a 75-inch interactive touch display, wireless screen casting, and glass dry-erase boards for sprint planning and collaborative coursework.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>9. Library and Learning Resource Centre (LRC)</h3>
                <p>Open 24/7 during term-time with swipe card access. Provides silent research floors, quiet carrels, an extensive physical book collection, and access to over 50,000 digital journals and tech ebooks through IEEE Xplore, ACM Digital Library, and O'Reilly.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>10. The Atrium Caf&eacute; &amp; Coffee Lounge</h3>
                <p>The social heartbeat of the campus, offering freshly brewed barista coffee, hot meals, healthy salads, and vegan/halal meal options at student-friendly prices.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>11. Fitness, Health &amp; Wellness Centre</h3>
                <p>Supporting physical and mental health with a modern gym equipped with cardio machines, free weights, resistance equipment, yoga/Pilates studio classes, and personal fitness consultations.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>12. On-Campus &amp; Partner Residence Halls</h3>
                <p>Modern, secure student accommodation within 5 to 10 minutes walk of campus, featuring en-suite bedrooms, high-speed 200Mbps Wi-Fi, communal kitchens, laundry facilities, and 24/7 residential warden support.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block" aria-labelledby="student-support">
    <div class="container two-col">
        <article class="card">
            <h2 id="student-support">2. Comprehensive Student Support &amp; Wellbeing</h2>
            <p>At Kasper College, we are committed to ensuring you receive all the pastoral and academic guidance you need throughout your university journey:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Academic Advising &amp; Personal Tutors:</strong> Every student is assigned a dedicated Personal Tutor from their department for regular 1-to-1 academic progress reviews and mentoring.</li>
                <li><strong>Mental Health &amp; Counseling Support:</strong> Free, confidential counseling sessions, mindfulness workshops, and crisis drop-in support available both in-person and online.</li>
                <li><strong>Disability, Accessibility &amp; Neurodiversity Service:</strong> Tailored support plans, assistive software licenses, exam adjustments, and one-on-one specialist study skills tutors.</li>
                <li><strong>Student Finance &amp; Emergency Hardship Fund:</strong> Expert advice on student loans, budgeting, scholarships, bursaries, and short-term interest-free emergency hardship assistance.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <h2>3. Kasper College Students' Union (KCSU) &amp; Campus Life</h2>
            <p>The Kasper College Students' Union (KCSU) is run by students, for students, representing your voice and organizing a rich calendar of social, academic, and recreational events:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Student Societies:</strong> Kasper Computing Society (KCS), Cyber Defense Guild, Game Developers Circle, Creative Design Collective, Women in Tech Network, Robotics League, Esports Association, and Outdoor Adventure Club.</li>
                <li><strong>Annual Hackathons &amp; Game Jams:</strong> The annual 48-hour Kasper Winter Hackathon brings together over 200 student coders and designers with prizes sponsored by leading tech firms.</li>
                <li><strong>Student Representation:</strong> Course and Department Reps elected each term work closely with faculty heads to drive continuous course improvements.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block section-alt" aria-labelledby="careers-it">
    <div class="container two-col">
        <article class="card">
            <h2 id="careers-it">4. Career Development &amp; Employability Services</h2>
            <p>Our dedicated Careers &amp; Employability Centre helps you turn your degree into a thriving career:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>1-to-1 Career Coaching:</strong> CV reviews, LinkedIn profiling, portfolio curation, and mock technical coding interviews.</li>
                <li><strong>Placement Support:</strong> Dedicated placement officers help you secure 12-month paid industrial placements and summer internships.</li>
                <li><strong>Kasper Tech &amp; Creative Careers Fair:</strong> Held every November in the Glass Atrium, featuring 40+ employers recruiting directly for graduate positions.</li>
                <li><strong>Alumni Mentoring Network:</strong> Connect with Kasper College alumni working at leading tech companies, gaming studios, and design consultancies worldwide.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <h2>5. Digital Campus Services &amp; IT Support for Students</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Campus Wi-Fi:</strong> Seamless, high-speed Eduroam wireless coverage across all campus areas and student residences.</li>
                <li><strong>Free Software Licenses:</strong> All registered students receive free Microsoft 365, GitHub Student Developer Pack, JetBrains IDE licenses, Autodesk suite, and MATLAB.</li>
                <li><strong>Virtual Learning Environment (VLE):</strong> 24/7 access to lecture recordings, course slides, assignment submission portals, and grades via Moodle.</li>
                <li><strong>Cloud Compute &amp; Printing Credits:</strong> Annual allowance of &pound;30 free cloud compute credits and 500 pages of double-sided campus printing per semester.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

